{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"You might not be aware of all the rules around how fey work and generally shouldn't need to be but there's one thing any sort of tinkerer needs to keep firmly in mind: Iron is distasteful to us. Small pieces of impure iron or alloys thereof are generally minor enough to not be too irritating, but large pieces of alloys or any pure iron makes us inherently want to avoid and distrust you. I can't tell which pieces exactly, but some of the trinkets and shavings stuck to your armor are pure cold iron. I'd advise you leave thos eelsewhere before you venture any further into our spaces.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:04:12.867000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865141691744518174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"Jigsaw's tail bristles as they look lovingly at their scrap metal armor. \"I've worked very hard to get my work this far, it is like a second skin to me!\" they seem angry, more at the general situation than Sonora specifically.","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:07:55.312000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865142624746471464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"yes, well how would you feel if someone walked around with a giant magnet playign the worst sound you'd ever heard?\" Sonora retorts. She seems genuinely frustrated.","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:12:01.725000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865143658277634129","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"I would make it make a different noise.\" they say snappily as they quickly pick up up a rock from the ground, swipe at it with their smiths tools and cause it to emit a melodious tone.","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:18:01.312000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865145166495350794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"(me the player: <:thisisfine:862361831690338345> Jigsaw: <a:anglitcheryfem:651662679261577237> )","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:18:56.795000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865145399206871042","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"You *can't* make it make a different noise. Because it's magnetically stolen all your tools.\" SOnora says through gritted teeth as though experiencing physical pain.","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:20:30.909000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865145793950646283","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"Well I wouldn't let my tools be stolen again, but even then, I would find another solution. Create earplugs. Drown out the noise with something better. Adapt.\" Their tail is puffed up like an angry animal and their face turns into an angry sneer.","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:27:30.060000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865147551995789332","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"And i suppose you think we haven't tried those sorts of things.\" Sighs Sonora. She rubs her temples, as if having a bad headache","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:31:10.151000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865148475124482049","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"Yes well, I won't be taking my armor off. If that means I have to go straight from the ferry to my next destination then so be it. But honestly, you are all powerful enough here you should have found a solution by now.\" They let out a huff.","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:35:04.751000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T08:40:50.782000Z","id":"865149459108331520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
